# Two-handed weapons (Rerac-vr's blaster.rs), with the RYNO: heavy in one hand, it droops and lags a
# fast turn of the hand; the left hand squeezed on its barrel holds it steady (no crouch: the squeeze
# is not R1) and aims it from the right hand to the left. [vr-hand] lines tell each step.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3200 shot rest
# A fast turn of the hand, 60 degrees: the RYNO stays behind, then follows.
3300 hand_yaw 60
3302 shot turning
3360 shot turned
3400 hand_yaw 0
# The left hand to the barrel (the RYNO's foregrip, 35 cm ahead of the right hand), squeezed.
3500 lh_x 0.4
3501 lh_y -0.06
3502 lh_z -0.35
3510 left_grip 1
3540 shot both
# The left hand raised: the barrel points up, from the right hand to the left.
3560 lh_y 0.15
3600 shot raised
3620 right_trigger 1
3650 right_trigger 0
3700 left_grip 0
3720 shot let-go
3800 quit 0
